      "source": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: platformer\n---\n# Welcome to Phase II platformer\n\nThis project was created from the **platformer** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.\n\n## Controls and setup (en)\n\nPlay: A/D to move, Space to jump. Click the Game viewport before using keys.\n\n### Expected result\n\nThe player moves and jumps on the ground/platform; an included sprite, idle clip, tile map and jump sound are attached.\n\nRequirements: Ready offline · Keyboard · Audio included\n\n## Steuerung und Einrichtung (de)\n\nPlay: A/D zum Bewegen, Leertaste zum Springen. Vor Tastatureingaben in die Spielansicht klicken.\n\n### Erwartetes Ergebnis\n\nDie Figur läuft und springt auf Boden/Plattform; Sprite, Idle-Clip, Tilemap und Sprungton sind enthalten.\n\nVoraussetzungen: Offline bereit · Tastatur · Audio enthalten\n\n## 操作与准备 (zh)\n\n播放后用 A/D 移动、空格跳跃；先点击游戏视口再按键。\n\n### 预期结果\n\n玩家可在地面和平台上移动跳跃；已绑定精灵、待机动画、瓦片地图和跳跃音效。\n\n使用要求: 离线可用 · 键盘 · 包含音频\n",
      "sourceControlStatus": "clean",
      "sourceModified": 0,
      "tags": [],
      "thumbnailKey": "",
      "uuid": "effcfd50-56bb-4964-8ffc-fd5056bb1964",
      "width": 0
    }
  ],
